  "body": "As a follow-up to #7274, should we add an index for HTTP headers the HTML specification defines? This seems somewhat useful. The MIME types index is apparently all MIME types the specification mentions, but does an HTTP headers index have to be consistent with that or is it fine if it lists introduced HTTP headers instead?",
